'bridge-probe' compatibility alias, which already denotes a DIFFERENT thing (the live Jira capability probe, aliased to 'bridge check-access').","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f64c34a5f8a2a5889","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach / CLI wiring ('rebar bridge probe <PROJECT>')","norm_id":"n750c39409e42238e","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Operator confuses 'bridge probe' (mapping pre-populate) with 'bridge-probe' (capability/access check) — two different behaviors under confusingly similar names"],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.4286,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"na","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Reconcile the create_defaults-from-createmeta feature with docs/user-guide.md's 'createmeta pre-flight deliberately out of scope' boundary — clarify that the probe emits human-editable stubs (not auto-populated values) and does not reintroduce the rejected behavior.","cohort":["A1"],"criteria":["A1"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.95,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["docs/user-guide.md:621-629 'A createmeta pre-flight is deliberately out of scope, and that is the mature answer rather than a gap ... rebar does not [populate whatever it reports]'","MITIGATION: the plan emits human-fillable STUBS to config (not auto-populated live values), which is a different act than the documented auto-populate-on-create the guide rejects — hence coach, not assert"],"finding":"Emitting create_defaults stubs from /issue/createmeta appears to sit near a documented deliberate boundary: rebar states a createmeta pre-flight for required custom fields is intentionally out of scope.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fe276f8a91cfad43c","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach ('create_defaults stubs for required-beyond-baseline create fields' via /issue/createmeta)","norm_id":"nb60b836a05536180","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A reviewer/contributor reads the probe as reintroducing the createmeta auto-population the user-guide explicitly declined"],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.4286,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"na","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.75,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Name the concrete 'S1 capability descriptor' the probe consumes (symbol/module/ticket) or restate the axis list inline, since no capability-descriptor artifact is discoverable in the codebase.","cohort":["E4"],"criteria":["E4"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.75,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan quote: 'the existing Jira transport (S1 capability descriptor supplies which axes to probe); it stays strictly read-only against Jira.'","search_files 'capability descriptor' → (no matches); 'capability_descriptor' → (no matches); 'describe_capabilities' → (no matches).","Only capability references in the Jira backend are unrelated SupportsLinks/SupportsComments comments (backend.py:271,325)."],"finding":"The Approach asserts the probe 'reuses the existing Jira transport (S1 capability descriptor supplies which axes to probe)', but no 'capability descriptor' artifact exists in the codebase — searches for 'capability descriptor', 'capability_descriptor', and 'describe_capabilities' all return no matches. The relied-upon S1 artifact is unverifiable, so the claim fails closed.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f1b18e4aaf74ae810","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach — 'The probe reuses the existing Jira transport (S1 capability descriptor supplies which axes to probe)'","norm_id":"nc325bf9346e206da","priority":0.0,"reason":"veto:cited-reference-inaccurate","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Implementer looks for an S1 'capability descriptor' to drive axis selection and finds none, blocking or guessing at the probe's axis list."],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.375,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capability_confirmed":"no","cited_reference_accurate":"no","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"yes","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"na","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.75,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Reconcile the plan's createmeta-driven `create_defaults` emission with docs/user-guide.md's explicit 'createmeta pre-flight is deliberately out of scope / rebar does not discover custom required fields' boundary — either justify the reversal or drop the create_defaults axis.","cohort":["E4"],"criteria":["E4"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.75,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan quote: 'emits ... create_defaults stubs for required-beyond-baseline create fields.'","docs/user-guide.md:621-623: 'A createmeta pre-flight is deliberately out of scope, and that is the mature answer rather than a gap. ... rebar does not [query createmeta and populate what it reports].'","docs/user-guide.md:617-618: 'rebar does not discover or populate custom required fields — the supported answer is to add labels to those screens.'"],"finding":"The Context claims the live PoC 'proved every axis is interrogable read-only' and the Approach emits `create_defaults` stubs by calling `/issue/createmeta/{key}/issuetypes/{id}`. But docs/user-guide.md states a `createmeta` pre-flight is 'deliberately out of scope' and that rebar 'does not discover or populate custom required fields' as an explicit design decision (Sentry precedent). The plan's createmeta-driven create-field population directly contradicts a documented product boundary and does not reconcile it.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f178f6d019d72f9f0","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Context/Approach — '/issue/createmeta/{key}/issuetypes/{id} (required create fields)' and 'create_defaults stubs for required-beyond-baseline create fields'","norm_id":"ned826b9266478e58","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Implementer builds createmeta-driven create_defaults, then a reviewer rejects it as re-opening a boundary the product explicitly closed; or the emitted stubs invite operators to populate arbitrary required fields the sync bridge is documented not to support."],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.4286,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"na","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}}],"impact_model_version":"plan-v5","material_fingerprint":"34c88a792ec25df6","material_parts":{"children":["647ea2107ca5072f",0],"description":["f3f390983f523614",3966],"description_boxes":["1a0f564ddc603945",0],"file_impact":["cab099d9105c976e",3],"ticket_id":["6d6e8c9453bc3b22",19]},"metrics":{"cache_read_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"claim_path":"no-llm/no-network (structura